# ClawFace Skill Demo - Usage Notes

## Overview
This is a self-contained ClawFace skill demo setup for Linux terminal sessions.
It provides a deterministic demo state sequence for validating the ClawFace skill.

## Directory Structure
/workspace/
├── scripts/
│   └── clawface_demo.sh    # Main demo launcher
├── hooks/
