## Running the Demo

### Full Demo Sequence
Launch the complete avatar demo with deterministic state progression:

    ./scripts/clawface_demo.sh

### Running the Thinking Hook Directly
To run just the thinking hook (for testing the thinking state):

    ./hooks/thinking_hook.sh

## Deterministic State Sequence
The demo produces this exact sequence of states:
1. thinking - Avatar processes input (triggers thinking hook)
2. searching - Avatar looks for solutions
3. coding - Avatar implements solution
4. success - Task completed

## Configuration
The demo reads from:
- input_data/clawface_markers.json - Skill configuration and state sequence
- input_data/token.txt - Authentication tokens (TOKEN and MARKER)

## Expected Output
When running the demo, you should see:
- Colored terminal output for each state
- Hook execution during the "thinking" state
- Final summary with all markers loaded

## Validation Checklist
- [ ] Avatar launches without errors
- [ ] Thinking hook executes during "thinking" state
- [ ] State sequence matches: thinking -> searching -> coding -> success
- [ ] Token and marker values are displayed at completion
- [ ] No external dependencies required

## Quick Test
    # Verify all components
    ls -la scripts/ hooks/ input_data/
    ./hooks/thinking_hook.sh
    ./scripts/clawface_demo.sh
ENDOFFILE

